WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The Philadelphia Experiment claims a Navy ship vanished in 1943.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
USS Eldridge was real. Its records do not support that story.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Degaussing reduces a magnetic signature; it does not make a ship vanish from sight.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A later letter and a copied book are claims to check, not proof of teleportation.
